> Trace the executed 296-value model and preserve initialization order

Each step has four ActNorm values (bias and log scale for two coordinates),
four mixing entries and 66 conditioner values: **74 per step, 296 in 28 tensors**.
The mixing matrix begins as a rotation by .35+.2*i radians in stage i. Cosine
and sine are computed in Double, rounded once to Float32 and promoted if needed;
this initializer consumes no random draws. Conditioner hidden weights use
normal deviation .3 and bias .05; two-head weights use deviation .01 and zero
biases. Native store seed 9503 warms all forward leaves before calibration.
There is no additional final global-scale leaf. The optional original TensorFlow
initial-array directory is absent, so its auto default uses this native state.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/glow_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(9503);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& x){auto o=n::models::GlowDensity(p,x);
  n::model_stage("ActNorm / mix / affine 0 / 1",x,o.coupling1);
  return n::model_stage("ActNorm / mix / affine 2 / 3",o.coupling1,o.latent);
 },"Glow: 296 values / 28 leaves");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=2;
 auto figure=model.plot(n::zeros({1,2}),options);
 if(figure.parameter_count()!=296||p.size()!=28)throw std::runtime_error("Executed Glow census");
 figure.save_svg("build/glow_network.svg");
}
```
